  "notes": "ETYMOLOGY:\nAbbreviation of \"costume play\" (コスチュームプレイ), coined in Japan.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- コスプレをする (to cosplay)\n- コスプレ{衣装|いしょう} (cosplay costume)\n- コスプレイヤー (cosplayer)\n- コスプレ{撮影|さつえい} (cosplay photography)\n- コスプレイベント (cosplay event)\n\nCULTURAL NOTE:\nCosplay originated in Japan and has become a global phenomenon. Major events include Comiket (コミケ) and World Cosplay Summit.\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {仮装|かそう} (costume/disguise)\n- コスチューム (costume)\n- レイヤー (layer - short for cosplayer)",
